# Checker: checking set-ups and their output sections
error-chk-contract-invalid = That output description is missing, has no sections, or has a section without a name. Correct it and try again.
error-chk-datastore-failed = ordin's saved work is busy just now. Try again in a moment.
error-chk-input-invalid = Something in that check isn't valid, such as an item that doesn't exist or a missing reason. Correct it and try again.
error-chk-instance-unknown = ordin has no saved check for that agent. Run the check first.
error-chk-resolver-failed = ordin couldn't build the set-up to check it. Try again in a moment.
error-chk-run-not-found = ordin can't find that check. It may be too old and have been cleared.
error-chk-source-already-bound = The source of parts has already been set. It can only be set once.
error-chk-source-not-bound = No source of parts has been set yet. Set one and try again.
error-chk-source-unavailable = ordin can't read the source of parts just now. Try again in a moment.
error-chk-too-many-findings = ordin couldn't make sense of what it was asked to check. Check that it is complete and try again.
error-exp-part-duplicate = That name is empty, too long, or already used for this kind of part. Choose another name.
error-exp-source-not-policy = That can only come from your organisation's policy, not from you.
